# GitHub OAuth App (dev)
# 1. Create at: https://github.com/settings/applications/new
# 2. Homepage URL: http://localhost:1420
# 3. Authorization callback URL: http://localhost:1420 (Device Flow のため任意で可)
# 4. Copy this file to .env and paste the Client ID below
# 5. Restart `pnpm tauri dev` (Client ID is baked in at Rust compile time)
GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id_here
